<section class="relative min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <canvas id="three-canvas" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0"></canvas>
    <div class="hero-bg grid-bg">
        <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-1/3 right-1/4 w-80 h-80 bg-purple-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-20 left-10 w-32 h-32 border border-cyan-400/20 rounded-full"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-40 right-20 w-24 h-24 border border-purple-400/20 rotate-45"></div>
        <div class="data-stream" style="left: 15%; animation-delay: 0s;"></div>
        <div class="data-stream" style="left: 85%; animation-delay: 1.5s;"></div>
        <div class="data-stream" style="left: 50%; animation-delay: 0.8s; width: 1px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="fade-item"><h1 class="font-serif text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-medium tracking-tight text-neutral-900 leading-[1.1] mb-8 glow-text tech-font" data-i18n-html="hero_title">Alpha Vision<br/>智慧先驅</h1></div>
        <div class="fade-item" style="transition-delay:0.1s"><p class="text-neutral-600 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed mb-12" data-i18n="hero_subtitle">基於先進骨骼偵測與人流智慧，賦能空間與人類行為的深度理解。</p></div>
        <div class="fade-item flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6" style="transition-delay:0.2s">
            <a href="/smartcare" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-cyan-500/30 transition-all duration-300 clickable shadow-lg inline-block relative overflow-hidden group neon-btn flow-border"><span class="relative z-10" data-i18n="hero_btn_products">探索產品</span><div class="absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-500 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-500"></div></a>
            <a href="/contact" class="border border-cyan-400/50 text-black px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-cyan-500/10 hover:border-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300 clickable inline-block neon-border" data-i18n="hero_btn_demo">預約演示</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12">
        <div class="tech-divider">
            <div class="tech-divider-line"></div>
            <div class="tech-divider-dot"></div>
            <div class="tech-divider-line"></div>
            <div class="tech-divider-dot" style="animation-delay: 0.5s;"></div>
            <div class="tech-divider-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="flowing-line" style="top: -10px; left: 10%; width: 80%; animation-duration: 2.5s;"></div>
        <div class="particle-stream" style="top: 0; left: 20%; animation-duration: 2s; --offset: 0.2;"></div>
        <div class="particle-stream" style="top: 0; left: 50%; animation-duration: 2.5s; --offset: 0.5;"></div>
        <div class="particle-stream" style="top: 0; left: 70%; animation-duration: 1.8s; --offset: 0.8;"></div>
        <div class="ring-glow" style="top: 20px; left: 15%; animation-delay: 0s;"></div>
        <div class="ring-glow" style="top: 20px; left: 85%; animation-delay: 1s;"></div>
        <div class="scan-bar" style="width: 100%;"></div>
        <div class="data-node" style="top: -5px; left: 10%; animation-delay: 0s;"></div>
        <div class="data-node" style="top: -5px; left: 30%; animation-delay: 0.3s;"></div>
        <div class="data-node" style="top: -5px; left: 50%; animation-delay: 0.6s;"></div>
        <div class="data-node" style="top: -5px; left: 70%; animation-delay: 0.9s;"></div>
        <div class="data-node" style="top: -5px; left: 90%; animation-delay: 1.2s;"></div>
        <div class="connection-line" style="width: 15%; top: 15px; left: 15%; transform: rotate(-5deg);"></div>
        <div class="connection-line" style="width: 20%; top: 25px; left: 40%; transform: rotate(3deg);"></div>
